---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { NON_AFFILIATION, SITE } from '../lib/site';

const breadcrumbs = [{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Disclaimer' }];
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Disclaimer"
  description="This site is independent and not affiliated with AKTU. Read the accuracy, source, and AI disclosure notes."
  breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}
  updated="16 November 2026"
>
  <h2>No affiliation with AKTU</h2>
  <p>{NON_AFFILIATION}</p>
  <p>
    We do not use the AKTU logo, seal, or official visual identity, and we do not claim to
    be an official university website.
  </p>

  <h2>Sources and accuracy</h2>
  <p>
    Syllabus facts come from official AKTU documents or verified sources. Notes,
    solutions, question banks, model papers, and guides are original study material. We
    link official documents instead of rehosting them. We try to keep dates, codes, and
    marks accurate, but university rules can change. Always confirm with the official AKTU
    page or your examination cell.
  </p>

  <h2>No guarantee of outcomes</h2>
  <p>
    We do not guarantee marks, ranks, results, scholarships, admission, or eligibility.
    Study material is a support, not a substitute for the official syllabus, classroom
    teaching, or your own work.
  </p>

  <h2>AI-assisted content</h2>
  <p>
    Some drafts are AI-assisted. Every published resource is reviewed by a human before it
    goes live. The page records whether AI assistance was used. If you find an error,
    report it and we will correct it.
  </p>

  <h2>External links</h2>
  <p>
    Links to AKTU and other third-party sites are provided for convenience. We do not
    control those sites and are not responsible for their content, availability, or
    policies.
  </p>

  <h2>Not professional advice</h2>
  <p>
    Nothing on this site is legal, medical, financial, or official academic advice. For
    decisions that affect your registration, examination, or career, consult the
    university or a qualified professional.
  </p>

  <h2>Report an issue</h2>
  <p>
    Corrections: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>
    <br />
    Copyright: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.grievanceEmail}`}>{SITE.grievanceEmail}</a>
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
